// =================================================================================================================== Tokyo Metropolitan Gymnasium
// Maki Fumihiko, 1990. The main arena on its OSM footprint (a circle of 118 m): low glazed walls under the big helmet-like roof of two
// leaf-shaped halves that lean against each other along a central ridge, clad in narrow metal strips, a skylight slot along the ridge
